{"info": {"address1": "Plot No 128/A", "address2": "Road No. 12, BEL Road IDA Mallapur, Uppal Mandal Rangareddy", "city": "Hyderabad", "zip": "500076", "country": "India", "phone": "91 40 2716 7000", "fax": "91 40 2715 0820", "website": "https://apollo-micro.com", "industry": "Aerospace & Defense", "industryKey": "aerospace-defense", "industryDisp": "Aerospace & Defense", "sector": "Industrials", "sectorKey": "industrials", "sectorDisp": "Industrials", "longBusinessSummary": "Apollo Micro Systems Limited designs, develops, and assembles electronic and electromechanical solutions in India. The company offers DSP, missile hardware simulators, integrated avionics modules, generic PCM encoders and decoders, DSSS de-modulators, seeker electronics, RPF and signal processing systems, turret control and power units, missile interface units, launcher controllers, launcher interface units, tiger sharc DSP-signal processors, quad actuator controllers, fault tolerant and system relay boxes, and DSP controllers; ESM-eagle kit, embedded arss, PSU, and auxiliary controllers; and integrated payload checkout systems, satellite data simulators, high speed frame synchronizers, time code readers/generators, bit synchronizers, monopulse tracking receivers, PCIE-HSDR, PCM-two channel decommutators, PCIe based two channel data acquisition cards, and PCI-X based two channel serial data acquisition cards. It also provides avionics and transportation solutions; public address display systems, warning systems, vehicle tracking solutions and command control solutions, minemaster, weight-in-motion systems, tyre care, passenger information systems, and station announcement systems; ethernet, base band modules, converters, USB/Ethernet protocol converters, dual data bus couplers, data bus solutions, and various formulas; and solar smart street lighting, CCTV surveillance, vehicle tracking, boom barrier, RFID fleet management, UAV detecting and jamming, GSM interception, Wi-Fi and lawful interception, and portable x-ray inspection systems, as well as passenger information displays, wall radar, reactive convoy and stationary jammers, and portable and stationary bomb jammers. In addition, the company offers electronic manufacturing, hardware design, IT and software, and electronic and mechanical CAD services. Apollo Micro Systems Limited was incorporated in 1985 and is based in Hyderabad, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Karunakar Reddy Baddam", "age": 63, "title": "Founder, MD & Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1962, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 18000000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sudarshan  Chiluveru", "age": 72, "title": "Chief Financial Officer", "yearBorn": 1953, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Krishna Sai Kumar Addepalli", "age": 46, "title": "Whole Time Director of Operations & Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1979, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2400000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Venkata Siva Prasad Chandrapati", "age": 54, "title": "Whole Time Director of Technical & Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1971, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2393000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Rukhya  Parveen", "title": "Company Secretary & Compliance Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Aluri Venkateswara Rao", "age": 53, "title": "President of Marketing", "yearBorn": 1972, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. K. C. Satyanarayana", "title": "Head of Special Products Group", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Commodore B.P  Singh", "title": "President of Strategic Projects", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}], "compensationAsOfEpochDate": 1767139200, "ex